555
00:24:51.659 --> 00:24:54.862
Look. to be honest.
I do the same thing.

556
00:24:54.895 --> 00:24:57.698
Come on.
Everyone here does it.

557
00:24:58.966 --> 00:25:02.269
Only that...

558
00:25:02.303 --> 00:25:05.172
