more than happy to contribute.

565
00:25:18.886 --> 00:25:24.225
Let's say $1.500 U.S.

566
00:25:24.258 --> 00:25:25.659
Hmm?

567
00:25:25.693 --> 00:25:28.329
Come on.

568
00:25:28.362 --> 00:25:30.297
