650
00:29:24.098 --> 00:29:26.267
- All right. all right.

651
00:29:31.338 --> 00:29:32.574
- Where's your gun?

652
00:29:32.607 --> 00:29:33.474
- It's under my jacket.

653
00:29:33.508 --> 00:29:35.376
