659
00:29:54.228 --> 00:29:56.531
- We're gonna go
for a little ride.

660
00:29:56.564 --> 00:29:58.600
- What are you doing?

661
00:29:58.633 --> 00:30:00.568
- Getting rid of your problem.
- You can't kill a cop.

662
00:30:00.602 --> 00:30:02.236
