- No. never mind.

673
00:30:30.331 --> 00:30:32.299
Just--
I'm on my way.

674
00:30:32.333 --> 00:30:34.602
Do not engage.

675
00:30:34.636 --> 00:30:36.970
<i>- 911. What's your emergency?</i>

676
00:30:37.004 --> 00:30:38.305
